<title>FRANCE: Castorama sees 11.6 pct '97 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Castorama sees 11.6 pct '97 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Castorama said on Monday it expects sales to rise 11.6 percent in 1997 to 20 billion francs and new store developments increasing its retail surface by seven percent.</p>
<p>The group gave the forecast in a financial notice where it also said 1996 sales rose 9.2 percent to 17.9 billion francs.</p>
</text>
